## SQ-CMP-09s | Weathered Cardboard Box: the startup blockstate assignment loads (server half of CQ-CMP-09)
@group A
@commands Any boot with the current Compat jar; `setblock ~ ~ ~2 creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box`
@pass no `decor_blocks.js` error in `logs/kubejs/startup.log`; the setblock succeeds
@fails a startup error on `blockstateJson`: Rhino did not convert the object to a JsonObject (set it from Java or `JsonIO` instead)
kjsreject decor_blocks.js
> setblock 0 -60 2 creativecompat:weathered_cardboard_box
expect Changed the block
@draft no batch holds this row yet

## CQ-CMP-09 | Weathered Cardboard Box wraps its texture
@group client
@commands Creative client: place a Weathered Cardboard Box, look at all six faces, hold it in the hand, check the inventory icon; F3+T is not needed (startup asset)
@pass LOOK: each face shows one tile of the sheet (not the whole sheet four times): taped top, plain flap bottom, a handle side north and south, label sides east and west, matching Design and Decor's cardboard box placed facing north; the box fills the full block
@fails the whole sheet on each face: the generated cube_all model still wins (blockstate not taken from `decor_blocks.js`); a face sideways or upside down: the face rotations of `block/weathered_cardboard_box_wrapped`
@draft no batch holds this row yet; needs a client
